            <div class="space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700">
              <p><strong>Morning-only (do before 2 PM):</strong> Hikes, scooter trips, beach, temple visits, photography, surfing. Rain usually hits 2–5 PM.</p>
              <p><strong>Afternoon-OK:</strong> Spas, yoga, restaurants, museums, markets, meditation.</p>
              <p><strong>All-day:</strong> Coworking, cooking classes, art workshops, colivings, meetings.</p>
              <p><strong>Avoid:</strong> Diving, long scooter trips, backpacking, beach days (water quality poor, waves rough).</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-yellow-50 rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 text-base sm:text-lg">Indoor Activities by Area (10 recommendations)</h3>
