            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700 mb-3">
              <strong>Risks:</strong> Roads slippery (moss from humidity). Visibility drops. Other drivers reckless. Avoid if possible.
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700">
              <strong>If you must:</strong> Slow down (40 km/h max). Avoid big roads. Don't brake hard. Light leather shoes for traction. Full-face helmet + visibility gear.
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700">
              <strong>Better:</strong> Grab when raining. Worth the extra cost for safety + peace of mind.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
