            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700">
              <li>✓ <strong>Choose:</strong> Room with good ventilation + ceiling fan</li>
              <li>✗ <strong>Avoid:</strong> Ground-floor rooms (humidity, mold risk)</li>
              <li>✓ <strong>Request:</strong> Rooms on higher floors (better airflow)</li>
              <li>✓ <strong>Look for:</strong> "Ensuite with AC" or verified reviews mentioning dry/clean</li>
              <li>✓ <strong>Bring:</strong> Dehumidifier packets (absorb moisture)</li>
              <li>✓ <strong>Do:</strong> Air out clothes + bedding daily</li>
            </ul>
